[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2975940160","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107558#issuecomment-2975940160","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107558","id":2975940160,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xYT5A","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T10:11:09Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T10:11:09Z","body":"This is not a bug, this is due to path casing, which is [documented](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/best_practices/project_organization.html#case-sensitivity)\n\n\nThere could be some detection for the path being invalid, but the same would happen if you provided an invalid path in some other way than casing differences, like `res://scene/player_controller.tscn`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2975940160/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3478111527","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107558#issuecomment-3478111527","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107558","id":3478111527,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PT8Un","user":{"login":"TimothyAlba","id":19917695,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTE3Njk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19917695?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba","html_url":"https://github.com/TimothyAlba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-02T17:05:42Z","updated_at":"2025-11-02T17:21:07Z","body":"To be clear this is an issue where the Windows file access code is adding the incorrect, case-insensitive metadata to the `PackedScene` which creates unexpected behavior later in the engine with other case-sensitive systems like the `Auto Spawn List` in the `MultiplayerSpawner`. This might not be an issue on Linux or case-sensitive systems which would fail at runtime, but this is a problem in developing on Windows and other case sensitive operating systems.\n\nI see three solutions:\n1. Maintain the engine as is and let developers run into the case issue when their game fails to run on case-sensitive OS. Downside is developers on case-insensitive OS will struggle to understand why their nodes aren't replicating as there is no debug error printed in the debug console later than `4.3-stable`, thus anyone on `4.4.x` and `4.5.x` and beyond will have no warning as to what might be happening.\n2. Figure out why the warning is not displaying in versions later than `4.3-stable`, fix it, and have it throw a runtime error instead of a warning. This would be much more effective than documentation as it informs the developer immediately what the issue is.\n3. Since Godot Engine is programmed to be case-sensitive as made apparent by this issue then code interacting with the OS should also be case aware if reasonably possible. This way you prevent unexpected behavior due to case-insensitive OS.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3478111527/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3478178942","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107558#issuecomment-3478178942","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107558","id":3478178942,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PUMx-","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-02T18:40:24Z","updated_at":"2025-11-02T18:40:24Z","body":"> This might not be an issue on Linux or case-sensitive systems which would fail at runtime\n\nThis will always fail at runtime for the exported project, as the exported project always accesses files in a case-sensitive way, see the above documentation\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3478178942/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3482899601","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107558#issuecomment-3482899601","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107558","id":3482899601,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PmNSR","user":{"login":"TimothyAlba","id":19917695,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTE3Njk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19917695?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba","html_url":"https://github.com/TimothyAlba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-03T22:40:04Z","updated_at":"2025-11-04T02:55:09Z","body":"> This will always fail at runtime for the exported project, as the exported project always accesses files in a case-sensitive way, see the above documentation\n\nSo the recommended workflow when unexpected or unexplainable behavior happens when running the code using the editor's run command is to export the entire project and run it again to see why it is failing?\n\nIf so I recommend adding this to the best practices documentation and probably highlight this further up in the documentation such as the introduction.\n\nAs for the warning not appearing in Godot versions later than `4.3-stable` would you recommend opening a new issue as this would be considered a regressive behavior since the case-sensitivity problem remains an issue when running from the editor.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3482899601/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3494639670","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107558#issuecomment-3494639670","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107558","id":3494639670,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QS_g2","user":{"login":"TimothyAlba","id":19917695,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTE3Njk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19917695?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba","html_url":"https://github.com/TimothyAlba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TimothyAlba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-06T03:00:23Z","updated_at":"2025-11-06T03:00:23Z","body":"@CutterDev did you see the following error print in the debug console when experiencing this unexpected behavior in version 4.4.1?\n```bash\n0:00:06:0928   game.gd:4 @ _ready(): Case mismatch opening requested file 'res://scenes/core/player/player.tscn', stored as 'res://scenes/core/player/Player.tscn' in the filesystem. This file will not open when exported to other case-sensitive platforms.\n  <C++ Source>   drivers/windows/file_access_windows.cpp:181 @ open_internal()\n  <Stack Trace>  game.gd:4 @ _ready()\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3494639670/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]